<title>CHINA: Frankfurt still Hong Kong's main non-Asian cargo.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt still Hong Kong's main non-Asian cargo.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frankfurt held its position as Hong Kong's largest air cargo partner outside Asia during May, latest Civil Aviation statistics show.</p>
